WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.083 --> 00:00:00.583
(static crackles)

00:00:00.583 --> 00:00:02.750
[Announcer] Hey kids,
do you want a friend

00:00:02.750 --> 00:00:04.958
who will never leave your side?

00:00:04.958 --> 00:00:05.417
(child chuckles)

00:00:05.417 --> 00:00:08.750
Introducing...
Chauncey The Bear!

00:00:08.750 --> 00:00:11.708
He'll never leave you.
Never ever.

00:00:11.708 --> 00:00:13.375
(woman screams)

00:00:13.375 --> 00:00:15.250
(static crackles)

00:00:15.250 --> 00:00:18.250
[Dr. Bloom] It's nice
to see you again, Alice.

00:00:18.250 --> 00:00:21.250
Jessica told me you've been
spending time with a new friend?

00:00:22.542 --> 00:00:24.583
[Alice] He doesn't want me
to talk to you.

00:00:25.875 --> 00:00:27.750
(static crackles)

00:00:27.750 --> 00:00:29.167
Chauncey?

00:00:30.167 --> 00:00:32.708
My favorite thing is his eyes.

00:00:32.708 --> 00:00:35.333
I can see anything I can
imagine in them.

00:00:35.333 --> 00:00:40.000
(ominous music)

00:00:40.000 --> 00:00:43.250
- He asked you to do something
that hurt you.

00:00:43.250 --> 00:00:45.250
(ominous music continues)

00:00:45.250 --> 00:00:47.750
(Alice cries)

00:00:49.417 --> 00:00:51.542
[Gloria] Every culture has
a name for it.

00:00:51.542 --> 00:00:54.125
We call them imaginary friends.

00:00:55.167 --> 00:00:58.292
(ominous music continues)

00:00:58.292 --> 00:01:00.792
Just because you stop
believing in them

00:01:02.542 --> 00:01:03.833
doesn't mean they're gone.

00:01:05.625 --> 00:01:07.958
And they're angry that you left.

00:01:07.958 --> 00:01:09.750
(Alice screams)

00:01:09.750 --> 00:01:10.750
- Go!

00:01:13.500 --> 00:01:18.500
(creepy music)
(child giggles)

00:01:25.250 --> 00:01:27.083
(Taylor inhales)

00:01:27.083 --> 00:01:29.958
(Taylor exhales)

00:01:29.958 --> 00:01:32.750
(dramatic music)

00:01:32.750 --> 00:01:33.917
(plug clicks)

00:01:33.917 --> 00:01:38.083
(Chauncey growls)

00:01:38.083 --> 00:01:40.583
(Taylor pants)

00:01:40.625 --> 00:01:42.375
(light rattles)

00:01:50.667 --> 00:01:51.500
(demon growls)

00:01:52.833 --> 00:01:55.333
♪ It was just my imagination ♪

00:01:55.333 --> 00:01:58.500
♪ Ooh ooh ooh ♪

00:01:58.500 --> 00:02:01.333
♪ Running away with me ♪

